[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2458793010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98880#issuecomment-2458793010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98880","id":2458793010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SjjQy","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T06:06:45Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T06:06:45Z","body":"Some access specifiers are duplicated on purpose, e.g. for semantic differences.\r\n\r\nFor example, there are two `public` sections in `TranslationDomain`, one is exposed to the engine and the other is additionally exposed to scripting.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/87318a2fb7fffeb72adca934e31915be077c3d1f/core/string/translation_domain.h#L67-L74","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2458793010/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459143586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98880#issuecomment-2459143586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98880","id":2459143586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sk42i","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T09:43:04Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T09:43:04Z","body":"> For example, there are two public sections in TranslationDomain, one is exposed to the engine and the other is additionally exposed to scripting.\r\n\r\nYou don't need access specifiers to separate them though, just put a comment.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459143586/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459425302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98880#issuecomment-2459425302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98880","id":2459425302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sl9oW","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T10:52:11Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T10:52:11Z","body":"> You don't need access specifiers to separate them though, just put a comment.\r\n\r\nA comment becomes ambiguous when there are more than one group in that section.\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Example</summary>\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n// These are not intended for scripting.\r\nvoid foo();\r\nvoid foo_bar();\r\n\r\nvoid foobar();\r\n\r\n// Doing things based on bar.\r\nvoid bar();\r\nvoid bar_foo();\r\n\r\nvoid whatever();\r\n```\r\n\r\nAre `foobar()` and `bar*()` part of \"these\" described above? Then we invent begin/end pairs in comments.\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n// Begin not intended for scripting.\r\n\r\nvoid foo();\r\nvoid foo_bar();\r\n\r\nvoid foobar();\r\n\r\n// Doing things based on bar.\r\nvoid bar();\r\nvoid bar_foo();\r\n\r\n// End not intended for scripting.\r\n\r\nvoid whatever();\r\n```\r\n\r\nThey are not that distinguishable from regular comments. Then we invent ASCII arts in comments :laughing: \r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2459425302/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465103708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98880#issuecomment-2465103708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98880","id":2465103708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S7n9c","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T15:55:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T15:55:36Z","body":"Closing following https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98881#issuecomment-2465101229","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465103708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"mini